  "urls": {
    "start_urls": [
      {"url": "https://...", "max_depth": 1}
    ]
  },
  "crawler_settings": {
    "max_pages": 200,
    "delay_seconds": 3.0
  }
}
```

I designed the configuration to be loaded from S3 at runtime, allowing:
- URL changes without redeployment
- Kill switch for emergency stops
- Tunable crawl parameters
